# Who reviews what. GitHub requests a review from the owners of every path a
# pull request touches; the LAST matching rule wins, so the stricter rules sit
# below the catch-all.
#
# An email owner must be a verified address on a GitHub account with write
# access to this repository, or GitHub routes nothing for that rule.

* joe@zennthic.com

# Authentication, OAuth and SSO: tenant isolation and sign-in live here.
/editor/auth*.py joe@zennthic.com
/editor/routers/oauth.py joe@zennthic.com
/editor/routers/sso.py joe@zennthic.com

# CI and deployment: a change here runs on, or ships to, our own machines.
/.github/workflows/ joe@zennthic.com
/deploy/ joe@zennthic.com
